347	/**
348	 * Renders the orchestrator run log viewer for a specific log file.
349	 *
350	 * Fetches all entries on load, then polls every 5 s for new entries using
351	 * the incremental `?after=N` parameter. Polling stops automatically when a
352	 * `run_end` or `run_error` entry is encountered.
353	 *
